    "_comments": [
      "The meetings entities (the meetings plan, § 4 and § 10). The UI role reads Standard meetings and the Private ones it attends, through the first row-level security filters this app ships; it writes meetings, series, attendees, agenda items, notes and links, and cancels rather than deletes a meeting or a series. Types and providers are read-only to it; Developer and Integration keep their full grants."
    ]
